Package: fingerprint-fpc
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Maintainer: zhanmq <zhanmq.china@gmail.com>
Depends: dbus, libusb-1.0-0
Recommends: libpam-fprintd
Provides: fprintd
Replaces: fprintd
Description: High-reliability FPC 10a5:9201 / 10a5:a900 fingerprint daemon
 Modern, memory-safe Rust drop-in replacement for fprintd,
 specifically engineered for FPC sensors (10a5:9201 and 10a5:a900)
 found in Xiaomi / RedmiBook laptops. Implements net.reactivated.Fprint.
